From bc28228695d7faa9a9806318b0a97a96965e683a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andreas Baierl <ichgeh@imkreisrum.de>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 08:57:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 46/59] Send the OSD in its own thread

OnPaint() sent every dirty region synchronously and blocked the UI
thread of the browser until VDR had drawn it: javascript, keys and the
next frame waited. Copy the regions into a frame buffer and send the
latest state from a separate thread, merging frames which arrive in
the meantime.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
